# slug: ch59-section-gc
# source: chapters/ch59.tex:242
# label: alg:ch59-section-gc
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch59.tex:245
# caption: Compute live input sections from a declared root and reference policy.

REQUIRE selected objects, resolved relocation targets, complete root set and implicit edges
ENSURE every section reachable under that policy remains live
mark roots and place them on a worklist
WHILE the worklist is nonempty DO
  remove section s
  FORALL reference edges s -> t DO
    IF t is unmarked THEN
      mark t and add it to the worklist
    END IF
  END FOR
END WHILE
discard only unmarked discardable sections; recompute layout afterward

